{"tuid":"mqat4cyt7y4qhg9l","pageVersion":5,"fetchedAt":"2026-09-30T09:55:56.751Z","record":{"colophon":{"generator":"ifdb.org/viewgame","generatorversion":1,"originated":"2025-04-22"},"identification":{"ifids":[]},"bibliographic":{"title":"Icepunk","author":"pageboy","language":"en","firstpublished":"2014-10-01","description":"&quot;You are the sole remaining inhabitant of an artificial world above a bizarre, inhospitable earth. A feral child raised by robots, you have just discovered the central computer of your Habitat, and unravelled the tale of a terrible catastrophe. But there is hope. Your task, as the heir to the human race, is to gather the data left in cold storage in the computers of the Caelan Cylinder, and from the icy landscape therein. You will face the wild processes of dead elemental minds, and see many maddening things in your journey through a landscape crawling with material informatics... all on a quest to create a future.&quot; <br> <br><i>Icepunk</i> is an experimental work combining a procedurally generated world, prefabricated content, non-linear exploration, public domain literature and social media excerpts - to probe the possibilities of Interactive Fiction."},"contacts":[],"ifdb":{"tuid":"mqat4cyt7y4qhg9l","pageversion":5,"link":"https://ifdb.org/viewgame?id=mqat4cyt7y4qhg9l","primaryPlayOnlineUrl":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition2014/Icepunk/icepunk.html","downloads":{"links":[{"url":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition2014/Icepunk/icepunk.html","playOnlineUrl":"https://ifarchive.org/if-archive/games/competition2014/Icepunk/icepunk.html","title":"Play Online","isGame":true,"format":"hypertextgame"}]},"averageRating":2.333333333,"starRating":2.5,"ratingCountAvg":15,"ratingCountTot":15,"tags":[{"name":"Animals","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":62},{"name":"artificial intelligence","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":97},{"name":"ASCII art","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":24},{"name":"bibliographical references","tagcnt":1,"gamecnt":12},{"name"